# Log levels since v1.1. log.level includes messages at that level and all lower numbers.
Level	Prefix	Description
0	CRIT	Critical errors, such as failure to bind the listener.
1	WARN	Warnings, including rejected connections and resolver-helper degradation.
2	INFO	Default. Includes the startup version, accepted game connections and enabled Metrics snapshots.
3	INFO	Also includes successful forwarded STATUS (MOTD) requests.

# Before configuration is available, startup diagnostics go to the console.
# Critical messages use stderr. Warnings and information use stdout.
# At readiness with non-terminal stdout (including systemd), the listener redirects
# stdout and stderr to /dev/null. Subsequent access records go to the configured log.
